WEBVTT

00:16:59.476 --> 00:17:03.371
and a parliament of citizens is a parliament of us,

00:17:03.371 --> 00:17:06.502
of you and of me.

00:17:06.502 --> 00:17:11.292
If ever there were citizens without borders,

00:17:11.292 --> 00:17:13.435
I think it's the citizens of TED

00:17:13.435 --> 00:17:16.626
who show the promise to be those citizens without borders.

00:17:16.626 --> 00:17:21.556
I am ready to reach out and embrace

00:17:21.556 --> 00:17:23.882
a new global democracy,

00:17:23.882 --> 00:17:26.981
to take back our democracy.

00:17:26.981 --> 00:17:29.119
And the only question is,

00:17:29.119 --> 00:17:31.178
are you?